  "label": "online social media users",
  "description": "The target community is individuals who engage with or observe online social media platforms, particularly those who are hesitant to post or comment despite having an interest in the content. The meme uses the visual and textual elements to humorously portray this common behavior, making it relatable to anyone who has experienced social anxiety or shyness in online contexts. The reference to 'The Matrix' and the tactical team imagery are cultural markers that appeal to internet meme culture, which is broadly accessible to users familiar with internet humor and pop culture references.",
